== About me
I'm currently a Research Assistant Professor jointly affiliated with the [https://www.polyu.edu.hk/comp/ Department of Computing] and the [https://www.polyu.edu.hk/iherd/ Institute for Higher Education Research and Development (IHERD)] at [https://www.polyu.edu.hk/ The Hong Kong Polytechnic University]. Before joining PolyU, I was an Associate Research Professor and a Research Assistant Professor at Zhongguancun Laboratory. I received my Ph.D. degree from the [http://www.cs.tsinghua.edu.cn/ Department of Computer Science and Technology], [https://www.tsinghua.edu.cn/ Tsinghua University], in 2023, advised by Prof. [http://routing.netlab.edu.cn/tiki-index.php?page=Mingwei+Xu/ Mingwei Xu]. I received my B.Eng. degree from the [http://www.ee.tsinghua.edu.cn/ Department of Electronic Engineering] at [https://www.tsinghua.edu.cn/ Tsinghua University] in 2018.
In Summer 2019, I was fortunate to visit [https://www.surrey.ac.uk/ University of Surrey] and worked with Prof. [https://www.surrey.ac.uk/people/ning-wang/ Ning Wang] at [https://www.surrey.ac.uk/institute-communication-systems/5g-innovation-centre/ 5G Innovation Centre]. 

== Research
My current research interests span AI for education and computer networks, with a focus on AI-empowered teaching and learning, transport protocols, routing security, and low-latency networked systems.

[research.html Explore research projects].
